    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>4级 杂兵 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 16，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 12</span><span>''侦查'' +1</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}手斧（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+9vs.AC<br>命中：8 伤害，冲锋攻击则为 12 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}手斧（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 5（一个生物）+9vs.AC<br>命中：6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">死亡狂暴✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：该兽人生命值降到 0。<br>效果（自由动作）：该兽人进行一个标准动作。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 16（+5）</span><span>''敏捷'' 13（+3）</span><span>''感知'' 9（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 8（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，巨人语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 革甲，4 把手斧</span></div></div>\n</div>",
